From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Sun, 15 Sep 2024 10:32:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Remove duplicate libjni_latinimegoogle definitions from gapps

---
 arm/Android.bp          | 7 -------
 arm/arm-vendor.mk       | 3 +--
